### Bill a ready/served order (use a served order's id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bills/orders/SERVED_ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### Retrieve the bill
GET {{baseUrl}}/bills/orders/SERVED_ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### Pay it (exact amount from bill response)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bills/orders/SERVED_ORDER_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"upi","amount":378}

### Daily report for today
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/daily?date=2026-09-03
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
